5: Useless `final` modifier, because the class is final.
8: Useless `final` modifier, because the class is final.
14: Useless `final` modifier, because PHP makes a property it writes privately final.
15: Useless `protected(set)` modifier, because PHP writes a public readonly property as protected.
16: Useless `private(set)` modifier, because the property is written as it is read.
18: Useless `protected(set)` modifier, because the property is written as it is read.
21: Useless `final` modifier, because the property is final.
25: Useless `protected(set)` modifier, because PHP writes a public readonly property as protected.
33: Useless `protected(set)` modifier, because PHP writes a public readonly property as protected.
